  "reasoning": "The defendants pretended to have large investment funds and a legitimate project, forged bank documents, and used these false representations to sign construction contracts and collect guarantee deposits and other fees from contractors. This constitutes fraud carried out through the signing and execution of contracts, which matches the legal definition of contract fraud (合同诈骗). No other crimes such as forgery of official documents are emphasized as the primary charge.",
